msgid "Lease cancel transaction cancels the leasing. See the :ref:`lease transaction <02_decentralchain/03_transaction:Lease Transaction>` article."
msgstr "Le contrat de location annule le contrat de location. Voir l'article :ref:`opération de location <02_decentralchain/03_transaction:Lease Transaction>`."

#: ../../02_decentralchain/03_transaction.rst:1092
msgid "The :ref:`minimum fee <02_decentralchain/03_transaction:Minimum Fee>` for a lease cancel transaction is :math:`0.001` :ref:`DecentralCoins <02_decentralchain/02_token(asset):DecentralCoin>`."
msgstr "Le :ref:`redevance minimale <02_decentralchain/03_transaction:Minimum Fee>` pour une transaction d'annulation de location est :math:`0.001` :ref:`DecentralCoins <02_decentralchain/02_token(asset):DecentralCoin>`."

